# Combined DEV pod (Advisor item 9, 2026-11-09): Stage 2 pilot, then Stage 1 dev, Qwen3-1.7B, GSM8K dev only.
# selfdoubt/s1s2_pod.sh runs stage2_pilot_pod.sh (rows below, PILOT_S budget, graceful) then stage0_full_pod.sh with
# RUNNER=selfdoubt/stage1_run.py (cut 0.9 = dev's largest UG-U0 gap, +0.187 [0.129, 0.249]; payloads plain + doc).
# Needs the user's own approval line in the Executor pane.
# Timing: pilot measured on dev rows (Qwen3-0.6B bf16, laptop RTX 3050): ~20 s/row -> 160 rows ~53 min central,
#   budget PILOT_S 5,400 s (90 min). Stage 1: 250 items x 15 continuations = 3,750; pod 1's dev CONT ran 2,750 in
#   1,840 s -> ~2,510 s + ~200 s install/load; step ceiling 3,300 s. Setup ~200 s.
# Central ~1 h 42 min ($1.00); ceiling ~2 h 35 min ($1.52); hard DELETE at 11,700 s = 3 h 15 min ($1.92).
